@Payment.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5210

### Initiate payment
POST {{Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Test-User-Sub: test-user-001
X-Test-User-Roles: PaymentAdmin

{
  "organizationId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
  "sourceSystem": "Enforcement",
  "payableReferenceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "correlationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "INR",
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-key-1",
  "provider": "Mock"
}

### List payments (admin)
GET {{Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments
X-Test-User-Sub: test-user-001
X-Test-User-Roles: PaymentAdmin

### Stats
GET {{Payment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/stats
X-Test-User-Sub: test-user-001
X-Test-User-Roles: PaymentAdmin
